      "title": "Lewis Hamilton visits Egypt’s Rafah crossing and Gaza aid facilities",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/10/lewis-hamilton-egypt-rafah-crossing-gaza-aid-facilities",
      "description": "<p>Seven-time F1 world champion tours border area and logistics warehouses operated by Egyptian Red Crescent</p><p>Lewis Hamilton has visited Egypt’s Rafah border crossing with the Gaza Strip to meet organisations sending humanitarian aid to the territory.</p><p>The seven-time Formula One world champion has spoken out about conflict and humanitarian crises in the region, and has called for peace. He has frequently posted on social media about children killed in Israeli airstrikes in Gaza and called for a ceasefire.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/10/lewis-hamilton-egypt-rafah-crossing-gaza-aid-facilities\">Continue reading...</a>",
